WEBVTT

00:16.863 --> 00:17.043
Bye.

00:45.113 --> 00:51.384
The ache is deeper now, a steady beat Stuck to

00:51.404 --> 00:58.383
this vinyl, sticky seat The endless plains of

00:58.503 --> 01:07.687
brown and grey Another piece of me slips away The

01:07.747 --> 01:14.030
world outside is vast and dead Matches the

01:14.150 --> 01:22.014
silence in my head My body's screaming needs a

01:22.174 --> 01:30.207
sign Somewhere on the side of the whole line Are

01:30.227 --> 01:36.328
you my lover? Or are you my guard? Is this a

01:36.348 --> 01:41.650
journey or a prison yard? There's a lock on the

01:41.750 --> 01:47.891
door, a bar on the sky And I'm starting to see the

01:48.011 --> 01:53.652
truth behind the lie A different kind of chill

01:53.812 --> 01:55.993
inside my soul

02:00.335 --> 02:03.076
of

02:08.118 --> 02:13.920
all control

02:14.580 --> 02:20.819
You hold the wallet, you hold the key To every

02:20.959 --> 02:29.008
single heart of me I see you watching from your

02:29.168 --> 02:37.669
seat Your victory feels so complete This wasn't

02:37.889 --> 02:44.113
an adventure, not a game You just needed someone

02:45.054 --> 02:53.219
else to blame A trophy for your bitter prize

02:53.659 --> 03:00.903
Reflected in your empty eyes Are you my lover?

03:02.064 --> 03:08.168
Are you my God? Is this a journey or a prison?

03:08.208 --> 03:14.612
Yeah, there's a lock on the door, a bar on the sky

03:14.832 --> 03:21.096
And I'm starting to see the truth behind the lie A

03:21.156 --> 03:26.139
different kind of chill inside my soul A

03:26.319 --> 03:35.884
creeping loss of all control I can't find my way

03:36.544 --> 03:45.309
back home I can't find my way back home

03:55.049 --> 03:55.310
you.

04:20.222 --> 04:26.947
Are you my God? Is this a journey or a prison yard?

04:27.087 --> 04:33.212
There's a lock on the door, a bar on the sky And I'm

04:33.292 --> 04:39.257
starting to see the truth behind the lie A

04:39.317 --> 04:43.781
different kind of chill inside my soul A

04:44.081 --> 04:49.085
creeping loss of all control

04:53.890 --> 04:55.491
Oh, yeah.

